Karpo Accelerate is an independent extension for MachinePulse AI's Karpo Decision.

Karpo Decision source API used by this project
https://github.com/machinepulse-ai/karpo-decision
Revision 6600011eb5cf46232d056ec0717dc726146d29de (Apache-2.0)

The compiler uses NVIDIA CUTLASS 4.2.1 (BSD-3-Clause) and vLLM 0.19.1
scaled matrix multiplication headers (Apache-2.0) from their upstream
repositories. Their sources and binaries are obtained separately.

The Karpo model checkpoint and associated terms are provided by MachinePulse AI.
https://huggingface.co/MachinePulseAI/karpo-decision-31B
